---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">

  <main class="py-8">
    <Hero 
      title="Privacy Policy" 
      description="Your privacy matters. This policy explains how Impact Orbit Creative Group handles personal data across our websites, brands, and services."
    />

    <section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-secondary-500">
      <div class="container-custom">
        <article class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-4xl mx-auto">

          <p class="mb-8 text-white dark:text-white">
            <strong>Effective Date:</strong> 30 July 2025
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">1. Who We Are</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            <strong>Impact Orbit Creative Group Ltd</strong> (“Impact Orbit”, “we”, “our”, or “us”) is a private limited company registered in England and Wales (Company No. 15207389).
          </p>

          <p class="mb-6">Our registered office is:</p>

          <address class="not-italic mb-8">
            DOCK – Space City<br />
            75 Exploration Drive<br />
            Leicester, LE4 5NU<br />
            United Kingdom
          </address>

          <p class="mb-6">
            We act as a data controller under the UK General Data Protection Regulation (UK GDPR) and are registered with the Information Commissioner’s Office (ICO) under Registration Number <strong>ZB640949</strong>.
          </p>

          <p class="mb-8">
            Impact Orbit Creative Group operates multiple specialist brands and initiatives, including <strong>Green Orbit Space Communications & PR</strong>. This Privacy Policy applies across Impact Orbit and all associated brands unless otherwise stated.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">2. What Personal Data We Collect</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We may collect personal data when you interact with our websites, brands, services, or communications.
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-6 mb-2">Website Usage Data</h3>
          <ul class="mb-6 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>IP address and referring domain.</li>
            <li>Device and browser information (operating system, browser type, screen resolution).</li>
            <li>Approximate location, language preferences, pages visited, and session duration.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="mt-6 mb-2">Communications and Services</h3>
          <ul class="mb-6 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>Information you provide when contacting us or engaging our services.</li>
            <li>Email correspondence, enquiry details, and stated preferences.</li>
            <li>Consent records where required by law.</li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="mt-6 mb-2">Analytics and Performance Monitoring</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We use analytics tools to understand how our websites and content are used, improve performance, and inform strategic decisions. Collected data is pseudonymised and not sold.
          </p>

          <ul class="mb-6 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>
              <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">
                Google Analytics Privacy Policy
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="https://www.gosquared.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">
                GoSquared Privacy Policy
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="mt-6 mb-2">Cookies</h3>
          <p class="mb-8">
            Cookies are used to ensure site functionality, analyse usage, and remember preferences. For more information, please see our
            <a href="/cookie-policy" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">Cookie Policy</a>.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
          <ul class="mb-8 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>To operate, maintain, and improve our websites and services.</li>
            <li>To communicate with you in response to enquiries or requests.</li>
            <li>To provide updates, insights, or marketing communications where permitted.</li>
            <li>To personalise content and measure engagement.</li>
            <li>To meet legal, regulatory, and contractual obligations.</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-8">
            Impact Orbit does not sell personal data.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">4. Who We Share Your Data With</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We may share limited data with trusted service providers that support our operations, including:
          </p>

          <ul class="mb-8 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>Google Analytics</li>
            <li>GoSquared Analytics</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mb-8">
            All third parties act under GDPR-compliant agreements and process data only for defined purposes. We do not share personal data for unrelated third-party marketing without explicit consent.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">5. Data Retention</h2>
          <p class="mb-8">
            Personal data is retained only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes described in this policy. Data is securely deleted or anonymised when no longer required. Where immediate deletion is not feasible (e.g. backups), data is securely isolated.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">6. Data Security</h2>
          <ul class="mb-8 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>Encryption of data in transit and at rest.</li>
            <li>Role-based access controls and strong authentication policies.</li>
            <li>Regular staff training on data protection and security.</li>
            <li>Automated vulnerability scanning and code analysis.</li>
            <li>API key management and optional mutual TLS (mTLS).</li>
            <li>Privacy-by-design and data minimisation principles.</li>
            <li>Background checks for staff handling sensitive data.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">7. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            If you are located in the UK, EEA, or Switzerland, you have the right to:
          </p>

          <ul class="mb-8 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>Access your personal data.</li>
            <li>Request correction or deletion.</li>
            <li>Object to or restrict processing.</li>
            <li>Request data portability.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">8. Do-Not-Track Signals</h2>
          <p class="mb-8">
            We do not currently respond to browser “Do-Not-Track” signals due to the absence of a universally accepted standard. This position will be reviewed if standards evolve.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">9. Policy Updates</h2>
          <p class="mb-8">
            This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect changes in law, technology, or operations. Significant changes will be communicated where reasonably practicable.
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 mb-4">10. Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="mb-6">
            For questions, concerns, or data-related requests, please contact:
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mb-6">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">
              Contact Us
            </a>
          </div>

          <address class="not-italic text-sm mb-8">
            Impact Orbit Creative Group Ltd<br />
            Email: <a href="mailto:hello@impactorbit.co" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">hello@impactorbit.co</a><br />
            Phone: +44 116 483 0155
          </address>

          <p class="text-sm mb-2">
            You may also contact the UK Information Commissioner’s Office:
          </p>

          <address class="not-italic text-sm">
            Wycliffe House, Water Lane<br />
            Wilmslow, Cheshire, SK9 5AF<br />
            Phone: 0303 123 1113<br />
            <a href="https://www.ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-500 hover:underline">
              www.ico.org.uk
            </a>
          </address>

        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

</Layout>